msgstr ""

msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Ami-chan"
msgstr "Sobre Ami-chan"

msgid "For a celebrity, you're not arrogant"
msgstr "Para ser famosa, no eres arrogante"

msgid "Ami is a cute name"
msgstr "Ami es un lindo nombre"

msgid "You have plenty of fanboys, right?"
msgstr "Tienes muchos admiradores, ¿verdad?"

msgid "About Modeling"
msgstr "Sobre el modelaje"

msgid "Seems you have tons of fans"
msgstr "Parece que tienes muchísimos fans"

msgid "How does it feel to be in magazines?"
msgstr "¿Qué se siente salir en revistas?"

msgid "Is it hard to balance school with work?"
msgstr "¿Cuesta combinar escuela y trabajo?"

msgid "About Her Face"
msgstr "Sobre su cara"

msgid "Your face is better-looking than most"
msgstr "Tu cara es más linda que la mayoría"

msgid "Do you have a special facial regimen?"
msgstr "¿Tienes una rutina facial especial?"

msgid "Do you wear makeup?"
msgstr "¿Usas maquillaje?"

msgid "About Her Figure"
msgstr "Sobre su figura"

msgid "You're stylish"
msgstr "Tienes mucho estilo"

msgid "Are you on a diet?"
msgstr "¿Estás a dieta?"

msgid "Girls are all so obsessed with their looks"
msgstr "Las chicas se obsesionan con su físico"

msgid "About Clothes"
msgstr "Sobre su ropa"

msgid "You've got great taste in clothes"
msgstr "Tienes muy buen gusto para vestir"

msgid "Could you pick out some clothes for me?"
msgstr "¿Podrías elegir ropa para mí?"

msgid "What's trendy this year?"
msgstr "¿Qué está de moda este año?"

msgid "--Let's Make Ami-chan Happy!--"
msgstr "--¡Hagamos feliz a Ami-chan!--"

msgid "Ami「You have such manly eyes, Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「Tienes una mirada tan varonil, Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Do I?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Yup, they kinda give me goosebumps.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sip, como que me dan escalofríos.」"

msgid "Ami「What's thiiis? Are you going to, like,＿confess your love?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y estooo? ¿Acaso me vas a,＿o sea, confesar tu amor?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Love!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Amor?!」"

msgid "Ami「You're nooot～? I got the wrong idea①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Nooo～? Me hice una idea equivocada①」"

msgid "Ami「Those looks could kill, Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「Esas miradas podrían matar, Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, s-sorry...... Did I scare you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, p-perdón...... ¿Te asusté?」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, that's not what I meant......」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, no me refería a eso......」"

msgid "Ami「Close your eyes for me?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Cierras los ojos por mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? A-Are you......? What!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Oh? ¿A-Acaso tú......? ¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, you like, stuttered①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, o sea, tartamudeaste①」"

msgid "Ami「This might be, like, my first time seeing＿you make that expression, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Puede que sea, o sea, la primera vez que＿te veo poner esa expresión, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Is it weird?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Es raro?」"

msgid "Ami「Nooope. It's cool①」"
msgstr "Ami「Para naaada. Se ve genial①」"

msgid "Ami「......Ehehe. Just looking into your eyes＿like this makes me SUPER happy①」"
msgstr "Ami「......Jejeje. Solo mirarte a los＿ojos así me hace SÚPER feliz①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......H-How should I respond to that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿C-Cómo debería responder a eso?」"

msgid "Ami「You could say \"I'm happy too.\"」"
msgstr "Ami「Podrías decir \"yo también estoy feliz\".」"

msgid "Ami「What's wrong? I want to, like, talk＿about something.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué pasa? Quiero, o sea,＿hablar de algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay then......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien entonces......」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? Someone like me couldn't＿be, like, a celebrity～」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quééé～? Alguien como yo no podría＿ser, o sea, una celebridad～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You ARE quite famous, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí que ERES bastante famosa, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ami「No I'm nooot①」"
msgstr "Ami「Claro que nooo①」"

msgid "Ami「That's because I'm with you, Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「Eso es porque estoy contigo, Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「When I'm with you, I can really be＿myself①」"
msgstr "Ami「Cuando estoy contigo, de verdad＿puedo ser yo misma①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「\"Ami-chan,\" remember? Like, try again.」"
msgstr "Ami「\"Ami-chan\", ¿sí? O sea, otra vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh my①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, vaya①」"

msgid "Ami「Only my name is cute～?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Solo mi nombre es lindo～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, that's not what I said.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No, no dije eso.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju①」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks～ Hearing you say that makes＿me SUPER happy, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias～ Oírte decir eso me＿hace SÚPER feliz, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh. I'm happy that you're happy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah. Me alegra que estés feliz.」"

msgid "Ami「Ufufu.」"
msgstr "Ami「Jujuju.」"

msgid "Ami「That's not true, like, at all～ I'm, like,＿not popular at all～」"
msgstr "Ami「Eso no es cierto, o sea, para nada～＿Yo, o sea, no soy nada popular～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like hell you aren't.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cómo que no lo eres!」"

msgid "Ami「Oh stop～ Silly Ryuuji, you're＿overestimating meee①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, para～ Tonto Ryuuji, me＿estás sobrestimandooo①」"

msgid "Ami「Even if I did have fanboys, there's like,＿only enough room in Ami-chan's heart＿for one.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aunque tuviera admiradores, o＿sea, en el corazón de Ami-chan＿solo hay lugar para uno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan is a fashion model, so my＿fans are mostly girls. You don't have to＿worry①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ami-chan es modelo de modas, así que＿mis fans son casi todas chicas. No＿tienes de qué preocuparte①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Worry? About what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Preocuparme? ¿De qué?」"

msgid "Ami「You know what I meannn～」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya sabes a qué me refierooo～」"

msgid "Ami「You're my only real fan, Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「Eres mi único fan de verdad, Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm not a \"fan\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no soy un \"fan\"......」"

msgid "Ami「If you're not a fan, then what?」"
msgstr "Ami「Si no eres un fan, ¿entonces qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I, I wonder. Haha.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......M-Me lo pregunto. Jaja.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm, like, SUPER embarrassed①」"
msgstr "Ami「Estoy, o sea, SÚPER avergonzada①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「More like SUPER happy to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A mí me pareces más bien SÚPER feliz.」"

msgid "Ami「Then I'm, like, happily embarrassed♪」"
msgstr "Ami「O sea, feliz de estar avergonzada♪」"

msgid "Ami「You won't know unless you tryyy. What＿if you were, like, scouted?」"
msgstr "Ami「No lo sabrás si no lo intentaaas.＿¿Y si, o sea, te descubrieran?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué......?」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju①」"

msgid "Ami「It's, like, a SUPER strange feeling to＿see myself on magazines in stores.」"
msgstr "Ami「Es, o sea, una sensación SÚPER rara＿verme en las revistas de las tiendas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Strange, huh...... Guess that's＿something I wouldn't know anything＿about.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Rara, ¿eh?...... Supongo que eso es＿algo de lo que no sabría nada.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh myyy, are you, like, worried about＿me? Thanks though～ I'm SUPER＿happy①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, vayaaa, ¿o sea que te preocupas por＿mí? Gracias～ Estoy SÚPER feliz①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well, don't wear yourself out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno, no te agotes demasiado.」"

msgid "Ami「Okaaay①」"
msgstr "Ami「Está bieeen①」"

msgid "Ami「Nooope, it's really not. I looove both＿school AND work.」"
msgstr "Ami「Para naaada, de verdad. Me encaaantan＿la escuela Y el trabajo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't overdo it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te excedas.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu. Thanks, Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju. Gracias, Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? Your flattery makes me＿SUPER happy①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quééé～? Tus halagos me＿hacen SÚPER feliz①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not just flattery.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es solo un halago.」"

msgid "Ami「I know, right～ You're not that kind of＿person. So I'm extra happy～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí, ¿verdad～? Tú no eres de esos.＿Por eso estoy más feliz～①」"

msgid "Ami「Ryuuji, do you like...... my face?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ryuuji, ¿te gusta...... mi cara?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh!? Uh, err, well, that's...... I think it's＿pretty.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ah?! Eh, ehm, bueno, pues......＿Creo que es bonita.」"

msgid "Ami「You like it?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Te gusta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Sí......」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu.」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju.」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? I don't do anything, like,＿special.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quééé～? No hago, o sea, nada especial.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Really really. If I did, I'd want to tell＿you①」"
msgstr "Ami「Muy en serio. Si lo hiciera,＿te lo querría contar①」"

msgid "Ami「All I have to do is apply my faaavorite＿person～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Mi único tratamiento es mi＿personaaa favorita～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu. Regimen in progress～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju. Rutina en progreso～①」"

msgid "Ami「Ryuuji, are you interested in＿cosmetics?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ryuuji, ¿te interesan los cosméticos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me? No no, I was just a little curious.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yo? No, no, era solo curiosidad.」"

msgid "Ami「Ah, I see～」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, ya veo～」"

msgid "Ami「Wanna see?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quieres ver?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm kinda interested.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como que me da curiosidad.」"

msgid "Ami「Next time, then①」"
msgstr "Ami「La próxima vez, entonces①」"

msgid "Ami「For work, yeah, but I don't normally.＿Maybe I should?」"
msgstr "Ami「Para el trabajo sí, pero normalmente＿no. ¿Debería hacerlo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, you're fine as is, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, así estás bien, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, thanks①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, gracias①」"

msgid "Ami「Yaaay! A compliment from Ryuuji①」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Yujuuu! Un cumplido de Ryuuji①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, how straightforward of you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, qué directa eres.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, I know it's not just, like, flattery＿coming from you. Ufu.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, sé que viniendo de ti no es＿solo, o sea, un halago. Juju.」"

msgid "Ami「Silly Ryuuji, you're like, so naughty.＿What are you, like, staring at?」"
msgstr "Ami「Tonto Ryuuji, o sea, qué atrevido eres.＿¿Qué estás, o sea, mirando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not! Not really......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Yo no! ¡En realidad no......!」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu ① No need to freak out～」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju ① No hace falta alterarse～」"

msgid "Ami「You think so? I'm not really, like,＿conscious of it～」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Tú crees? La verdad es que,＿o sea, no me doy cuenta～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I think your style screams \"model\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Creo que tu estilo grita \"modelo\".」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks. Hearing you say that makes＿me a little more confident, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias. Oírte decir eso me da un＿poco más de confianza, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ami「I, I don't think you should, like, have＿this conversation with a girl...... I'm＿sorry, okay?」"
msgstr "Ami「Y-Yo creo que no deberías, o sea,＿tener esta conversación con una＿chica...... Lo siento, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You're right. Sorry......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「T-Tienes razón. Perdón......」"

msgid "Ami「That's because I want my faaavorite＿person to see all of me①」"
msgstr "Ami「Es porque quiero que mi personaaa＿favorita me vea por completo①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-Is that right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-En serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Yup, so be sure to look①」"
msgstr "Ami「Sip, así que asegúrate de mirar①」"

msgid "Ami「I don't want you to think I'm, like, fat,＿Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「No quiero que pienses que estoy,＿o sea, gorda, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're not fat at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estás gorda para nada.」"

msgid "Ami「Really? Like, that's good.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿De verdad? O sea, qué bien.」"

msgid "Ami「I got a compliment from Ryuuji～ Oh＿my～ I'm, like, SO happy～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Recibí un cumplido de Ryuuji～ Ay,＿vaya～ Estoy, o sea, TAN feliz～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you really that happy about it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De verdad te hace tan feliz?」"

msgid "Ami「The whole reason I'm stylish is to hear＿you say I'm cute, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Cuido mi estilo solo para oírte＿decir que soy linda, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu① Do you like this?」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju① ¿Te gusta esto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Do you like Ami-chan?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Te gusta Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Oh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... ¡¿Ah?!」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu.」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm a model, so I have to hone my＿fashion sense.」"
msgstr "Ami「Soy modelo, así que tengo que＿pulir mi sentido de la moda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're eager to learn, huh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tienes ganas de aprender, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Like, okay～! We could go, like, right＿now if you wanted～ But you might end＿up with my taste in clothes～」"
msgstr "Ami「¡O sea, claro～! Podríamos ir, o sea,＿ahora mismo si quisieras～ Pero podrías＿terminar con mi gusto para vestir～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, I'd feel kinda awkward......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces me sentiría incómodo......」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju①」"

msgid "Ami「Let's see...... Is it okay if we get＿everything from a single brand～?」"
msgstr "Ami「Veamos...... ¿Está bien si compramos＿todo de una sola marca～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thought you'd say that...... As long as＿it's a brand a high-schooler can afford.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sabía que dirías eso...... Que sea una＿marca al alcance de un estudiante.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm, like, just kidding. I'll pick you out＿something cool AND affordable～＿Ufufu.」"
msgstr "Ami「O sea, es broma. Te voy a elegir algo＿genial Y accesible～ Jujuju.」"

msgid "Ami「Ryuuji is like, all the rage in my heart＿right now.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ryuuji es, o sea, la gran tendencia＿en mi corazón ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not what I meant......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me refería a eso......」"

msgid "Ami「Make Ami-chan your next fad, okay?」"
msgstr "Ami「Que Ami-chan sea tu próxima moda, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......A-Alright.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......E-Está bien.」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm...... Not sure. But the clothes I＿wore in last month's issue seem to＿have, like, caught on.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmm...... No estoy segura. Pero la ropa＿que usé en el número del mes pasado＿parece que, o sea, se volvió popular.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wow. So you're a trendsetter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Guau. ¿Así que marcas tendencia?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh my, I didn't mean it like that. I'm＿sure it's just, like, a coincidence.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, no lo dije con esa intención. Seguro＿es solo, o sea, coincidencia.」"

